{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/watchandtv"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use SuperwallKit in watchOS 8+ and tvOS 15+ apps to track purchases, subscription status and entitlements. Install with Swift Package Manager and configure the SDK with the same API as on iOS:"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"code":["import SuperwallKit","","let options = SuperwallOptions()","options.shouldObservePurchases = true","Superwall.configure(apiKey: \"YOUR_PUBLIC_API_KEY\", options: options)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"What’s available","anchor":"Whats-available","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuring, identifying users, user attributes, placements, purchases, restores, observer mode, subscription status, entitlements, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo"},{"type":"text","text":", web checkout redemption and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SuperwallDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" work as on iOS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neither platform has a web view, so paywalls, the debugger, Test Mode and Customer Center aren’t available. The APIs that only make sense with a paywall on screen, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":", don’t exist on these platforms."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Placements","anchor":"Placements","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register(placement:)"},{"type":"text","text":" still runs the campaign’s audience filters:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A holdout, or a placement with no matching audience, is skipped and runs the feature, as on iOS."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a paywall would be shown, the feature is unlocked as on iOS when a paywall fails to load. A non-gated feature runs. A gated feature doesn’t, and the handler’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onError"},{"type":"text","text":" gets an error instead. If the paywall can’t be fetched, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onError"},{"type":"text","text":" gets that error. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPresent"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" aren’t called, since nothing is shown."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getPresentationResult(forPlacement:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns the paywall the user would see. Implicit placements, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"app_launch"},{"type":"text","text":", don’t trigger anything."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Platform differences","anchor":"Platform-differences","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tvOS: local notifications, such as free trial reminders, aren’t scheduled because tvOS notifications can’t show text."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"watchOS: the connection type is reported as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unknown"},{"type":"text","text":". The device’s interface type is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"watch"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MMP install matching and Apple Search Ads attribution don’t run on either platform."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CocoaPods doesn’t install SuperwallKit on these platforms."}]}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit"],["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallKit"]]},"metadata":{"title":"watchOS and tvOS","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SuperwallKit"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/WatchAndTV","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"https://superwall.com":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com","title":"Superwall","url":"https:\/\/superwall.com","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Superwall"}]},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallKit":{"role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallKit","title":"`SuperwallKit`","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwallkit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The client SDK for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a service that lets you remotely configure, present and iterate paywalls – helping you find winners quickly."}],"kind":"article"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","title":"SuperwallKit","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"}}}